@ui @shared
Feature: Shared UI behavior

    Scenario: As a user, I should navigate to comparison, detailed search, brands and blog pages, when I click the related header links

    Scenario: As a user, I should see perfume, brand, note, accord or blog suggestions and reach a perfume detail page, when I type at least two characters in the header search field

    Scenario: As a user, I should see AI search results or an appropriate error without an empty request, when I submit kışlık hafif erkek kokusu in the header search field

    Scenario: As a user, I should see my selected theme after a page reload, when I click the theme toggle

    Scenario: As a user, I should see and close the mobile navigation panel without horizontal overflow, when I open the mobile menu at 375 pixels
